      <title>研究称数据中心不压房价 卖家却强烈反对</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260904/%E7%A0%94%E7%A9%B6%E7%A7%B0%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E4%B8%AD%E5%BF%83%E4%B8%8D%E5%8E%8B%E6%88%BF%E4%BB%B7-%E5%8D%96%E5%AE%B6%E5%8D%B4%E5%BC%BA%E7%83%88%E5%8F%8D%E5%AF%B9/</link>
